  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a24b9bf0f54f2724d9d632e8749df982, type: 3}
  m_Name: ASH_GrandpasJournal
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ASH.Prologue.ASHJournalCollection
  collectionId: grandpa
  title: Grandpa's Journal
  contentVersion: 2
  pages:
  - id: gj_01
    number: 1
    title: Water you can trust
    type: 0
    text: 'Creek water looks clean and isn''t. Boil it - a rolling boil, a full minute
      - or it''ll lay you flat for a week. Keep two bottles full, always. If the
      sky ever turns grey, wet a rag and tie it over your mouth before you do anything
      else.


      If the car gives up on you, the old Ford is out by the shed.'
    sketch: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6df6c26ce4ab7cc40bd22bf46788c15a, type: 3}
    area: Grandpa's cabin
    location: Kitchen table
    pointsTo: Grandpa's truck (out by the shed)
    placed: 1
    compassMarker: 0
    markerPosition: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
    markerReachRadius: 0
    chainFlag: 
    rareRecipeName: 
  - id: gj_02
    number: 2
    title: The old Ford
    type: 1
    text: The Ford still has some life in her, if you treat her right. Tires are
      shot - I've got one spare by the shed and I left the other at the old camp.
      Took the battery down to the old quarry to run the pump. The fan belt's at
      the ranger station - Hal was matching me a new one. Twenty litres in the can
      I left at the washout will get you to Red Rock.
    sketch: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7e36b1e175e63414b85bc9054e7d84fa, type: 3}
    area: Grandpa's truck
    location: On the ground by the truck
    pointsTo: Shed and old campsite (tires), Old Quarry (battery), Ranger Station
      (fan belt), washout cache (fuel)
    placed: 1
    compassMarker: 0
    markerPosition: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
    markerReachRadius: 0
    chainFlag: truckFound
    rareRecipeName: 
  - id: gj_03
    number: 3
    title: The shack spur
    type: 1
    text: Past the cattle guard the shack spur turns off this road - follow the cairns
      uphill. The shack roof leaks but the stove draws. If the valley road floods,
      that trail and the ridge get you around it.
    sketch: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7fb2fb2655fc1f74eb049a78dc2d3e71, type: 3}
    area: Arrival road
    location: Roadside, near where you drive in
    pointsTo: Hunting shack (shack spur trail)
    placed: 1
    compassMarker: 1
    markerPosition: {x: 3413.7358, y: 117.606606, z: 3275.9597}
    markerReachRadius: 0
    chainFlag: page:gj_03
    rareRecipeName: 
  - id: gj_04
    number: 4
    title: The hunting shack
    type: 2
    text: 'Loose board by the stove - that''s my cache. Arrows: straight shoots,
      dried a week, fletch with three feathers and a spit-wet thread. Make a dozen;
      you''ll lose half. The old camp is down the ridge, past the burnt pines.'
    sketch: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4626b319883a89b438ccf57c9eb61018, type: 3}
    area: Hunting shack
    location: Under the loose floorboard (M3)
    pointsTo: Abandoned camp
    placed: 0
    compassMarker: 0
    markerPosition: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
    markerReachRadius: 0
    chainFlag: 
    rareRecipeName: ASH_Recipe_WoodenArrows
  - id: gj_05
    number: 5
    title: Shelter that seals
    type: 1
    text: A tent stops rain, not ash. Pitch it behind a wall, wet sheet over the
      door, fire outside the flap. Spare tire's under the tarp here. I left supplies
      in the old ore box past the ridge - follow the rail ties.
    sketch: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ea0ff01487f669140b34e23f97dcdfcd, type: 3}
    area: Abandoned camp
    location: Camp entrance (M3)
    pointsTo: Supply cache (ore box past the ridge)
    placed: 0
    compassMarker: 0
    markerPosition: {x: 553.5288, y: 431.96774, z: 2306.3574}
    markerReachRadius: 0
    chainFlag: page:gj_05
    rareRecipeName: 
  - id: gj_06
    number: 6
    title: Breathing in the grey
    type: 2
    text: 'Those old masks take a can filter. Pack one yourself: tin shell, charcoal
      from a cold fire, cloth both ends, wax the seam. Change it when breathing gets
      hard. From here the Red Rock road is a day''s walk east.'
    sketch: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fec65690103a0d54cbae0c47f1c175fe, type: 3}
    area: Supply cache
    location: Inside the ore box (M3, position TBD)
    pointsTo: Red Rock road
    placed: 0
    compassMarker: 0
    markerPosition: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
    markerReachRadius: 0
    chainFlag: 
    rareRecipeName: ASH_Recipe_FilterCartridge
  - id: gj_07
    number: 7
    title: Before I go
    type: 1
    text: The bridge at the turnoff holds a truck if you go slow. Red Rock has a
      radio and a doctor. Don't stop in the cut when it's falling heavy.
    sketch: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5f8462c9806ee3c468113801a39e85aa, type: 3}
    area: Red Rock road
    location: Turnoff sign (M4, position TBD)
    pointsTo: Red Rock
    placed: 0
    compassMarker: 0
    markerPosition: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
    markerReachRadius: 0
    chainFlag: 
    rareRecipeName: 
  - id: gj_08
    number: 8
    title: Scooter
    type: 0
    text: Scooter rides up front and growls before you see trouble. Trust that dog.
      Feed him first, he earns it.
    sketch: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8fa4d153f56e9f745b843d8e19d66100, type: 3}
    area: Grandpa's truck
    location: Sun visor, once the truck runs (M4)
    pointsTo: Red Rock
    placed: 0
    compassMarker: 0
    markerPosition: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
    markerReachRadius: 0
    chainFlag: 
    rareRecipeName: 
